Here's an analysis of the scene based on the provided information about a potential corner case scenario involving heavy rain:

### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:scene1 a ex:Scene ;
    ex:entity ex:Vehicle1 ;
    ex:entity ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:entity ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:entity ex:Billboard1 ;
    ex:entity ex:Pavement ;

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasType "Car" ;
    ex:hasCondition "Visible" ;
    ex:isIn ex:scene1 .

ex:WeatherCondition a ex:Weather ;
    ex:hasType "Rain" ;
    ex:hasVisibility "Low" ;
    ex:isIn ex:scene1 .

ex:RoadInfrastructure a ex:Infrastructure ;
    ex:hasType "Road" ;
    ex:hasCondition "Wet" ;
    ex:isIn ex:scene1 .

ex:Billboard1 a ex:Billboard ;
    ex:hasCondition "Visible" ;
    ex:isIn ex:scene1 .

ex:Pavement a ex:Pavement ;
    ex:hasType "Sidewalk" ;
    ex:isIn ex:scene1 .
```

